{{Item|Diamond Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in the {{Zone|crystal hollows}}.

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Diamond Essence}} can be be obtained in the {{Zone|dwarven mines}}, {{Zone|crystal hollows}}, and the [[Catacombs]] in multiple ways:

* Opening [[Crystal Hollows#Treasure and Loot Chests|Crystal Hollows Treasure Chests]].
* Completing the [[Crystal Nucleus]].
* [[Dungeon Secrets|Dungeon Secret Chests]]
* [[Salvaging#Diamond|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Diamond Essence}}.
* Unlocking [[Diamond Heads]] in Boss Collections.
* Unlocking {{NPCSprite|Gemma}}'s Shop.
* Trading with {{NPCSprite|Gemma}} visitor in {{Zone|The Garden}}.
